{
    "nodes": [
        {
            "id": "99f04ea2-d6a4-466c-adcf-0f4bc7c24f60",
            "index": 0,
            "characterId": "779fc004-2448-4634-9021-02c63e148789",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3128",
            "content": {
                "en": "Ah, it’s you! I heard you drumming just now—you were really good!",
                "zh": "啊，是你！我刚才听到你敲鼓了，敲得很好嘛！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3969.33349609375,
            "positionY": 230.66665649414063,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "afbe8126-6912-48ec-a0af-7dba44b09c39",
            "index": 1,
            "characterId": "d5be2dcf-87aa-4ebc-afce-674209069707",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3129",
            "content": {
                "en": "(I feel a little embarrassed somehow.)",
                "zh": "（总感觉有点不好意思。）",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 4288.0,
            "positionY": 230.66665649414063,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "de1ff29c-3bca-46d8-8dd9-5a044d3b7041",
            "index": 2,
            "characterId": "779fc004-2448-4634-9021-02c63e148789",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3130",
            "content": {
                "en": "I didn’t expect you to actually go up there and play. How was it? Pretty exhausting, right?",
                "zh": "没想到你真的会去敲啊，感觉怎么样？挺费体力的吧？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 4616.0,
            "positionY": 230.66665649414063,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "477b1f08-62f8-4fde-84c5-6a2196406d29",
            "index": 3,
            "characterId": "443ed651-99c1-456e-8295-e76ba2741aa7",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3131",
            "content": {
                "en": "It’s fine, it was actually quite fun. (Though it was a bit tiring.)",
                "zh": "没事，还挺有趣的。（虽然确实有点累。）",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 4950.0,
            "positionY": 228.66665649414063,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "d17d865e-ff8c-4226-b5ee-e0b008cdcb8b",
            "index": 4,
            "characterId": "779fc004-2448-4634-9021-02c63e148789",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3132",
            "content": {
                "en": "Haha, you looked like you were really enjoying yourself—that’s great!",
                "zh": "哈哈，你看上去玩得很尽性呢，太好了！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 5268.66650390625,
            "positionY": 228.66665649414063,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "09f0ab82-77eb-4b9a-9412-d58499ef14c1",
            "index": 5,
            "characterId": "779fc004-2448-4634-9021-02c63e148789",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3133",
            "content": {
                "en": "Your friend must be thrilled!",
                "zh": "你朋友肯定也高兴的不得了！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 5601.3330078125,
            "positionY": 232.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "9a4de1f3-1829-49bd-9e71-d15f41cc335f",
            "index": 6,
            "characterId": "c5690423-74d1-4bca-8967-89da828b1a25",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3134",
            "content": {
                "en": "I hope so. But I’m not sure where she went.",
                "zh": "那样就太好了。但我不知道她现在去哪里了。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 5930.0,
            "positionY": 230.66665649414063,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "6088d2d8-c3bc-41a8-a92f-547d9c0e4a37",
            "index": 7,
            "characterId": "779fc004-2448-4634-9021-02c63e148789",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3135",
            "content": {
                "en": "Oh, after the performance, the participants should head to Jinlan Temple to wait for the awards. Just keep going right.",
                "zh": "啊，表演完之后的人员应该会去金兰观那边等待颁奖，你一直往右走就是了。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 6270.0,
            "positionY": 234.66665649414063,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "b468c6c9-e359-4630-abba-1995192cf714",
            "index": 8,
            "characterId": "547590f1-5207-4943-a81f-41ae946214ce",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3136",
            "content": {
                "en": "(Jinlan Temple... does that mean I might run into Zhou Shu?)",
                "zh": "（金兰观......那是不是能碰见周书呢？）",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 6600.66650390625,
            "positionY": 234.66665649414063,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "5cc455b8-ed83-4568-86b2-fbc2da8d2bf4",
            "index": 9,
            "characterId": "c5690423-74d1-4bca-8967-89da828b1a25",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3137",
            "content": {
                "en": "Got it, thank you so much!",
                "zh": "我知道了，非常感谢！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 6936.0,
            "positionY": 234.66665649414063,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "d0c6ff8a-6c91-4166-b943-b25090bf90d2",
            "index": 10,
            "characterId": "779fc004-2448-4634-9021-02c63e148789",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_3138",
            "content": {
                "en": "Haha, don’t mention it. I hope your friend wins!",
                "zh": "哈哈哈！别客气。希望你朋友能赢啊！",
                "ja": ""
